        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "eb3dad3f-6a33-3f96-9407-07ede370e563",
                "word": "déflagration",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ac75df1b-c022-4eab-8874-1ad892e42f77",
                        "entry_id": "eb3dad3f-6a33-3f96-9407-07ede370e563",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "déflagrations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "86ab5d1e-9f59-3252-911e-1148549dbb2b",
                        "entry_id": "eb3dad3f-6a33-3f96-9407-07ede370e563",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Combustion, accompagnée d’explosion, d’un corps qui se décompose."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0803f473-f976-3b80-9a7f-3bb741151c2a",
                        "entry_id": "eb3dad3f-6a33-3f96-9407-07ede370e563",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Explosion violente et bruyante d’une charge ou d’un mélange explosif, avec une vive projection de flammes et de chaleur intense."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Plus courant"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef2c6566-70d8-4906-a032-42565f40a510",
                                "sense_id": "0803f473-f976-3b80-9a7f-3bb741151c2a",
                                "text": "Pourtant, les hostilités sont loin d’être terminées pour les Parisiens qui voient Charentonneau, un quartier de la commune de Maisons-Alfort situé au sud-est de la capitale, secoué par une violente déflagration le 8 du même mois."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "971f9bb0-631d-319e-a508-eeb8ad43f688",
                        "entry_id": "eb3dad3f-6a33-3f96-9407-07ede370e563",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Manifestation intense, subite et violente, rappelant une explosion et une combustion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Par métaphore"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "928f2833-41d1-4f08-aabb-85d319753479",
                                "sense_id": "971f9bb0-631d-319e-a508-eeb8ad43f688",
                                "text": "Et sa mère, loin de lui expliquer quoi que ce soit, de l’aider à affronter ces révélations qui provoquent une déflagration mentale et laissent la pensée à plat, en miettes, refuse d’en discuter, elle s’acharne même à nier les faits, allant jusqu’à taxer les informations de mensonges, et de trucages les photographies divulguées."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2381487-7135-46bd-abb2-403afdd443c0",
                                "sense_id": "971f9bb0-631d-319e-a508-eeb8ad43f688",
                                "text": "Un soir, j’avais dit, à une tige surmontée d’un bouton : « Fleuris. » Le lendemain, c’était devenu une pivoine blanche en pleine déflagration."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "37d82f05-5867-42eb-af4e-63b549483ac2",
                        "source_entry_id": "eb3dad3f-6a33-3f96-9407-07ede370e563",
                        "target_lang_word": "deflagration",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "deflagration",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e42735e-7de9-3997-8416-b6a619810221",
                                        "entry_id": "155bca31-fb03-3470-912e-5d19b566962e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of deflagrating; an intense fire; a conflagration or explosion. Specifically, combustion that spreads subsonically via thermal conduction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "835e6971-58e8-4d68-949b-564903bd592e",
                                                "sense_id": "2e42735e-7de9-3997-8416-b6a619810221",
                                                "text": "If, for example, the mixture of oxygen and hydrogen was twenty volumes, and three volumes of oxygen remained after the deflagration, the mixture consisted of six volumes of hydrogen and six volumes of oxygen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "267a77b8-f4b1-464f-ba15-e409dcd70b3e",
                                                "sense_id": "2e42735e-7de9-3997-8416-b6a619810221",
                                                "text": "Black powder . . . It produces a relatively fast burn or deflagration rather than a detonation and is classified as \"low explosive\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eec3324e-aafa-4422-8089-5e59c509fe6f",
                        "source_entry_id": "eb3dad3f-6a33-3f96-9407-07ede370e563",
                        "target_lang_word": "conflagration",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "conflagration",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7ea42c1-fd93-398a-8e62-d48e7ef6c202",
                                        "entry_id": "9885dc36-84a2-318c-b22e-7c0394b028c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A large fire extending to many objects, or over a large space; a general burning."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88c98293-f842-45d4-8478-24dd0adc516a",
                                                "sense_id": "b7ea42c1-fd93-398a-8e62-d48e7ef6c202",
                                                "text": "It took sixty firefighters to put out the conflagration."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c7f03d1-3f0e-46aa-a1c0-40a30eb4c0b7",
                                                "sense_id": "b7ea42c1-fd93-398a-8e62-d48e7ef6c202",
                                                "text": "And back to hell his way did he take, / For the Devil thought by a slight mistake / It was general conflagration."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8dc97334-a4e4-34ef-a76a-70ad14a0ec3f",
                                        "entry_id": "9885dc36-84a2-318c-b22e-7c0394b028c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A large-scale conflict."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6aff09a-1b77-4a13-9e11-d021c8299e65",
                                                "sense_id": "8dc97334-a4e4-34ef-a76a-70ad14a0ec3f",
                                                "text": "This was well brought out in the skillfully conducted campaigns by the various governments in appealing to the masses with their characteristic suggestible subconsciousness, stirring to the very depths the reflex consciousness of gregarious man by all sorts of direct and indirect suggestions of fear of attacks and patriotic reactions of self-defence against such attacks until the evil genie of self-preservation and fear became loose, resulting in a sweeping conflagration of a war of nations with all the horror of diseases, mutilation, and extermination of millions of human lives, over seventeen and a half millions, according to latest accounts, having perished in this world-massacre of the human race."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8136c1c8-9a4b-33c6-9840-13da28e12d1c",
                                        "entry_id": "9885dc36-84a2-318c-b22e-7c0394b028c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A situation of great passion or emotion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c4db2c5-e4b0-43d9-87e4-ad6e9b0792c0",
                                                "sense_id": "8136c1c8-9a4b-33c6-9840-13da28e12d1c",
                                                "text": "I thought it only an amourette when you told me. It was a fire — a conflagration; subdue it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "afa3d1e7-e8fc-4190-a83e-fd03d0096760",
                        "source_entry_id": "eb3dad3f-6a33-3f96-9407-07ede370e563",
